      "statement": "Container images are chosen by a fixed order: spark-arena rebuilds first, then eugr images consumed via the spark-arena rebuild rather than direct, then a vendor image named by the model's own docs, then official vllm/vllm-openai as a fallback that lacks the GB10/NVFP4/FlashInfer work.",
