      "statement": "The selection order is also a security order because it tracks provenance reconstructibility: spark-arena rebuilds carry a full label chain (dev.sparkrun.* source/vllm/flashinfer hashes) while a direct eugr pull has no build labels at all, so consuming eugr through the spark-arena rebuild is what makes an opaque image documented.",
